        "Title": "Taking a leak",
        "Location": "LOCATION_COLORADO",
        "PublicId": "109182595201",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Colorado_2/_scene_bull.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 40fa42d8-2164-411b-9547-e5551ca99233).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, agent.\r\rYour target is Tyrone Balderas, nicknamed Tiny Bladders.\r\rThe target is diagnosed with prostate cancer in an early stage.\r\rHe is scheduled for an operation in Hokkaido next month, and is likely to make a full recovery, so our client has paid to make sure he will not be around for his appointment.\r\rThere has been rumors in the camp that the target is often taking a leak near the camp fence.\r\rUse this to your advantage, and lead him to a... Shocking demise.\r\rGood hunting.",
